{"task_id": "Mbpp/252", "solution": "import math\ndef convert(value) -> tuple[float, float]:\n    \"\"\"Convert numeric input (complex, int, float) to polar coordinates.\n\n    Args:\n        value: complex | int | float\n\n    Returns:\n        Tuple (r, theta) where both are floats.\n    \"\"\"\n    z = complex(value)\n    real = z.real\n    imag = z.imag\n\n    r = math.sqrt(real*real + imag*imag)\n    theta = math.atan2(imag, real)\n\n    return (r, theta)"}
