{"task_id": "Mbpp/410", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\ndef _is_numeric(x) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True if x is int or float and not bool (BR1).\"\"\"\n    return (isinstance(x, (int, float)) and not isinstance(x, bool))\ndef min_val(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Return the smallest numeric value (int or float) from input_list.\n    Raises TypeError if input_list is not a list (BR4).\n    Raises ValueError if no numeric elements are present (BR3).\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"input must be a list\")\n    numeric_items = [x for x in input_list if _is_numeric(x)]\n    if not numeric_items:\n        raise ValueError(\"no numeric elements\")\n    return min(numeric_items)"}
