{"task_id": "Mbpp/425", "solution": "def count_element_in_list(list_of_sublists, element):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of sublists containing a particular element.\n    Each sublist is counted at most once, even if the element appears multiple times.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for sublist in list_of_sublists:\n        if element in sublist:\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
