{"task_id": "Mbpp/474", "solution": "def replace_char(input_string: str, target_char: str, replacement_char: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Validate inputs and return a new string where every occurrence of target_char is replaced by replacement_char.\"\"\"\n    _validate_input(input_string, target_char, replacement_char)\n\n    result_chars = []\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char == target_char:\n            result_chars.append(replacement_char)\n        else:\n            result_chars.append(char)\n            \n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
