{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "from typing import Optional\ndef triangle_area(radius) -> Optional[float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the area of the largest triangle inscribed in a semicircle.\n    Handles negative, zero, and positive radius values.\n    \"\"\"\n    radius_float = float(radius)\n\n    if radius_float < 0:\n        return None\n    elif radius_float == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return radius_float ** 2"}
