{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def _effective_k(n, k):\n    \"\"\"Computes the effective rotation amount using modulo for n > 0.\"\"\"\n    return k % n\ndef rotate_right(lst, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a given list by a specified number of items to the right.\n    This function validates inputs, handles edge cases, and returns a new list.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_inputs(lst, k)\n\n    n = len(lst)\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return lst.copy()\n\n    effective_k = _effective_k(n, k)\n\n    if effective_k == 0:\n        return lst.copy()\n\n    return lst[-effective_k:] + lst[:-effective_k]"}
